<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan jobless rate 10.6 pct,up 0.1 pct mo/mo.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan jobless rate 10.6 pct,up 0.1 pct mo/mo.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's unemployment rose to 10.6 percent in January from 10.5 percent in December, the Labour Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    HUNGARY JOBLESS	   Jan 97    Dec 96   Jan 96</p>
<p>    registered unemployed   474,500   477,500  517,800</p>
<p>    rate (pct)		   10.6	10.5     11.3</p>
<p>NOTE - The basis for calculating the unemployment rate was updated to the size of the active population on January 1, 1996 from the previous basis of active population on January 1, 1995, the ministry said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
